# Milestone: v0.6.2-language-completion Phase 1
# Covers: float-literal lex + parse + emit + VM round-trip.
#         Decimal float only (hex floats out of scope per v0.6.2 locked
#         sub-decisions).  Disambiguation rule: `0.foo` is INT(0) DOT
#         IDENT(foo); only INT followed by '.' then a digit promotes to
#         TOK_FLOAT.  Leading-dot form `.5` dispatched from ulex_next when
#         the first char is '.'.
# Audit:  Closes Gap #5 of v0.6.2-language-completion.

